ike oh my god  each one of these pictures there were  moments I was seeing something that was  so extraordinary I was so overwhelmed is  really that I couldn't even speak or or  function it was that incredible  it happened in Nebraska when ball the  sandhill cranes came in at sunset  I understand now why I'm a birder and  why people do this and why they spend  their lives you know following these  species because it is one of the most  extraordinary things I've ever witnessed  [Music]  you  [Music]  you  [Music]

